## What "Eco Friendly Wedding Rentals" Doesn't Mean Here

We do not supply biodegradable tents, sustainable furniture, recycled decor or local catering, and we are not going to claim the Wedding Pack greens up parts of your wedding it has nothing to do with. If a fully sustainable wedding matters to you, those choices, venue, catering, decor and favors, sit with vendors in those trades, and our [essential items for wedding rentals](/blog/essential-items-for-wedding-rentals/) guide covers where AV fits alongside them.

